From bca96795d22e422aa50ebb894cf731c04e065bb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:35:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(map): view modes, sorting, default type filters

Add list/cards/tiles layout switcher and hostname/IP/MAC sort on the
network map. Default type filters are Laptops and desktops (SB); reset
returns to that preset. Layout and sort persist in localStorage and URL.
---
